[b]CSS v1.0.0-beta.12[/b]

[b]Added[/b]
[list]
[*]Support for Peony's expanded customization, texture palettes and flowing trim.
[*]Shared animation and facial-playback support for compatible outfits.
[/list]

[b]Fixed[/b]
[list]
[*]Keep your current body-motion settings when a performance ends and the normal animation returns.
[*]Support Peony's face mesh and ghost materials for customized Genessa doubles.
[/list]

[b]Updating[/b]
Close the game and replace the CSS runtime. Install the matching CSS Shared Assets download separately under MortalShell2/Content/Paks/~mods. Replace the older CSS_SharedAssets_P folder and remove CSS_AstralSharedAssets_P and CSS_LocomotionSharedAssets_P if present. Keep your settings and saved profiles. Install Eve v1.5.0 separately for Peony.
